("SL-C09","Oversee contaminated-site cleanup and remediation funds","Manage cleanup projects and contractors at brownfield, hazardous, Superfund-state-share and UST sites; review work plans and reports against standards; administer cleanup fund claims and cost recovery.","DC","SC","waste & remediation","state|local|federal","stable","fiscal|policy-reform","E","SL-077|SL-082|SL-074","6.7.1|3.1.4|4.4.4","PA ECB and MI MUSTA postings show remediation project and fund administration as standing state roles. v1 has only hazmat awareness (4.4.4) and risk assessment (6.7.1).","SL"),
